      "id": "claim_a2d9d6ee1a224830abb7cc38628274ce",
      "statement": "The application entry point is vn.onepay.pspconnector.Main, which loads app.properties, initializes a HikariCP Oracle data source from database.* properties, configures the OnecommPaymentServiceProvider and its handlers, injects the data source into service classes, then starts the Vert.x server.",
